      "description": "This folder contains all endpoints related to user account management within the NotesRestfulAPI. It covers the full lifecycle of a user, from registration and authentication to profile updates and account deletion.\n\n**Endpoints included:**\n- **Create User** `POST /user/createUser` — Registers a new user account.\n- **User Login** `POST /user/login` — Authenticates an existing user.\n- **Get User** `GET /user/getUser` — Retrieves the details of a user.\n- **Update Username** `PATCH /user/updateUsername` — Updates the user's username.\n- **Update Email** `PATCH /user/updateEmail` — Updates the user's email address.\n- **Update Password** `PATCH /user/updatePassword` — Updates the user's password.\n- **Delete User** `DELETE /user/deleteUser` — Permanently removes a user account."
    },
