      "description": "This folder contains all endpoints related to **Note** management. It covers the full lifecycle of a note, including:\n\n- **Creating** a new note (`POST /note/createNote`)\n    \n- **Retrieving** a single note or a list of notes (`GET /note/getNote`, `GET /note/getNotes`)\n    \n- **Updating** note content (`PUT /note/updateNote`) as well as individual properties such as color, label, cosmetics, pinned status, hidden status, and deleted status (via `PATCH` endpoints)\n    \n- **Deleting** a note (`DELETE /note/deleteNote`)\n    \n\nUse these requests to interact with the Notes REST API running locally on `http://localhost:8080`."
    },
