      "description": "This folder contains all endpoints for managing UI Templates within the application. It provides full CRUD functionality, allowing clients to create, retrieve, update, and delete templates.\n\n**Available Operations:**\n- **Create** (`POST /uitemplate/create`) — Create a new UI template.\n- **Read** (`GET /uitemplate/getTemplates`) — Retrieve a list of all available UI templates.\n- **Update Details** (`PATCH /uitemplate/updateTemplateDetails`) — Modify the details/content of an existing template.\n- **Update Name** (`PATCH /uitemplate/updateTemplateName`) — Rename an existing template.\n- **Delete** (`DELETE /uitemplate/deleteUserTemplate`) — Remove a UI template from the system.\n\nAll requests target the base URL `http://localhost:8080`."
